<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88265" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπάτωρ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ορος</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατήρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>first founder
				of a family, forefather,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				4.89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.161
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				9.122
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1441
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ Ζεῦ, προγόνων προπάτωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					387
				</span></i>
			 (lyr., s.v.l.); opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατήρ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				931d
			</span></i>; <i>ancestor</i> of a tribe, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				446.3
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Phrygia</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὸς ὁ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.44
			</span></i>, cf.Id.ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.11.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.1213
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1215
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thyatira</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διόνυσος ὁ π. τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					39.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				4.157
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Erythrae</span>); <i>primal god,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Par.
				1.1988
			</span></i>, <i>PMag. Leid.V.</i><i><span class="en">
				7.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῶν ἐν γενέσει δημιουργὸν
					προτάττουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					8.4
				</span></i>
			: in pl., <i>ancestors, forefathers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.169
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				717e
			</span></i>; <i>founders, inventors</i> of arts and sciences, Vett.
				Val.<i><span class="en">
				3.22
			</span></i>.</div>
